    "body": "> https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1145 wants to use the equivalent of JavaScript's % operator. This is surprisingly subtle because of the difference between modulo and remainder.\r\n\r\nFor Streams, the difference doesn't matter, since we only ever have *positive* dividends and divisors. From a quick look at Encoding, I think the same applies there.",
